#
# Counter-example for the counterfactualStratumC flagship: a
# logic:CounterfactualAcceptanceWitness naming NO logic:selectedByEntrenchment
# outcome — an outcome chosen without a recorded ordering is an arbitrary guess.
# Trips logic:CounterfactualAcceptanceWitnessShape (sh:minCount 1) →
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (logic:UnentrenchedCounterfactual), and no
# other finding. Bound by ex:ecCounterfactualUnentrenched.
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/logic/> .

ex:counterfactualWitness a logic:CounterfactualAcceptanceWitness .
